      "title": "[HCM] Senior Automation Test Engineer - upto 80M",
      "description": "**Industry:** Financial Services & Banking\nWhat you'll do\n* Build and maintain automation frameworks for Mobile, UI, API & Integration testing.\n* Integrate automated tests into CI/CD (Jenkins, GitLab CI).\n* Improve test coverage, quality, and release reliability.\n* Collaborate with Engineering, QA & DevOps teams.\n* Mentor team members and drive automation best practices.\n Requirements\n* 5+ years in QA Automation.\n* Strong experience with **Python (Robot Framework), Appium, Playwright, Jenkins, GitLab CI**.\n* Experience with UI, API, and system integration testing.\n* Knowledge of microservices; Kafka is a plus.\n* Fintech/Banking experience and professional English are preferred.\nBenefit\n* Salary: up to 80M\n* Work on large-scale digital banking products.\n* Regional engineering environment.\n* Hybrid: **4 days onsite (HCMC) + 1 WFH**.\nContact:\nEmail: phanthenho.work@gmail.com\nZalo/Tele/WhatsApp: +84 775 357 812",
